      <VERS vnumber="3">Therefore <gr str="935">came </gr>all the <gr str="2205">elders </gr>of <gr str="3478">Israel </gr>to the <gr str="4428">king </gr>to <gr str="2275">Hebron</gr>; and <gr str="1732">David </gr>
