      <VERS vnumber="13">He was with <gr str="1732">David </gr>at <gr str="6450">Pasdammim</gr>, and there the <gr str="6430">Philistines </gr>were <gr str="622">gathered </gr>to <gr str="4421">battle</gr>, where was a <gr str="2513">parcel </gr>of <gr str="7704">ground </gr>
