      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="14">And they <gr str="3320">set </gr>themselves in the <gr str="8432">midst </gr>of <STYLE css="font-style:italic">that </STYLE>
        <gr str="2513">parcel</gr>, and <gr str="5337">delivered </gr>it, and <gr str="5221">slew </gr>the <gr str="6430">Philistines</gr>; and the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>
