        <gr str="2583">encamped </gr>in the <gr str="6010">valley </gr>of <gr str="7497">Rephaim</gr>. <DIV>
          <NOTE type="x-studynote">three…: or, three captains over the thirty</NOTE>
        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="16">And <gr str="1732">David </gr>
