      <VERS vnumber="17">And <gr str="1732">David </gr>
        <gr str="183">longed</gr>, and <gr str="559">said</gr>, O that one would give me <gr str="8248">drink </gr>of the <gr str="4325">water </gr>of the <gr str="953">well </gr>of <gr str="1035">Bethlehem</gr>, that <STYLE css="font-style:italic">is</STYLE> at the <gr str="8179">gate</gr>!</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="18">And the <gr str="7969">three </gr>broke <gr str="1234">through </gr>the <gr str="4264">host </gr>of the <gr str="6430">Philistines</gr>, and <gr str="7579">drew </gr>
