        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">it</STYLE>, and <gr str="935">brought </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">it</STYLE> to <gr str="1732">David</gr>: but <gr str="1732">David </gr>
        <gr str="14">would </gr>not <gr str="8354">drink </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">of</STYLE> it, but poured it <gr str="5258">out </gr>to the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>,</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="19">And <gr str="559">said</gr>, My <gr str="430">God </gr>
