          <NOTE type="x-studynote">that have…: Heb. with their lives?</NOTE>
        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="20">And <gr str="52">Abishai </gr>the <gr str="251">brother </gr>of <gr str="3097">Joab</gr>, he was <gr str="7218">chief </gr>of the <gr str="7969">three</gr>: for <gr str="5782">lifting </gr>his <gr str="2595">spear </gr>against <gr str="7969">three </gr>
