      <VERS vnumber="21">Of the <gr str="7969">three</gr>, he was more <gr str="3513">honourable </gr>than the <gr str="8147">two</gr>; for he was their <gr str="8269">captain</gr>: but he <gr str="935">attained </gr>not to the <STYLE css="font-style:italic">first </STYLE>
